# Qguard Helix PQAuth — Deep Technical Audit, Workflow Visualization, and Enterprise UI/UX Enhancement

## Objective

Perform a comprehensive technical audit, functional review, and UI/UX improvement of the following seven PQAuth modules in Qguard Helix.

The goal is to ensure that every module is correctly implemented, properly connected to the backend, accurately displaying actual system data, and providing clear, intuitive visual representations of its purpose, workflows, processes, dependencies, and operational status.

Transform the PQAuth experience into a **premium, professional, user-friendly, and enterprise-grade post-quantum authentication platform** with intuitive workflows, interactive diagrams, clear status indicators, and subtle, purposeful animations.

Do not limit the work to visual redesign. Review the actual implementation, identify root causes of functional issues, fix verified defects, and test the results.

